 "_help": "Concept tags: a small fixed vocabulary so a shortlist is a filter, not a read of every one-liner. Each tag lists the words that suggest it (whole words; a trailing * matches any ending: \"nostalgi*\") in a clip's one-liner, description, feel and colour. concept_tags.py uses them to give untagged clips and pins a first set of tags; whoever writes a new one-liner also writes its tags from this list (add a tag here when a concept keeps coming up). Tags describe the clip as a whole: a shot inside it can still differ, so the shot's moment is checked too.",
